flowchart TD
    S[Source: generation excluded] --> P[Parse and intern]
    P --> K[Resolve constants]
    K --> C[Borrow cached root AST]
    C --> I[Index and aliases]
    I --> L[Lower references: resolve values once]
    L --> W[Reuse resolved values for weights; preserve IR layout]
    L --> H[Legacy hash; build canonical paths once]
    H --> N[Validate namespace and hash using shared paths]
    N --> E[Compact Pruefer: degree and neighbor XOR]
    E --> R[Compiled program cache]
    R --> Q[Prepared execution]
    C -.profile.-> D[Choose measurable optimization]
    L -.profile.-> D
    H -.profile.-> D
    D --> V[Parity + before/after latency and memory]

